  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project For Raising Voter&apos;s Awareness and Promoting  Digitalization  of the Electoral Process in Bangsamoro</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In May 2025, the Philippines will hold national and Bangsamoro Parliament elections in the Bangsamoro Autonomous Region in Muslim Mindanao (BARMM). These elections are key for promoting democratic governance and inclusion, but challenges such as voter disenfranchisement, particularly among women, youth, indigenous people, and a lack of awareness about the Parliaments role, persist. To address these issues, UNDP, with COMELEC, and the Embassy of Japan, will focus on improving voter education, ut</narrative>
  </description>
